<body>
<div class="Section1">
<h1>Phase 4: Project Planning Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) Milestones &amp; Risk Mitigation</strong></p>

<h2>1. Work Breakdown Structure (WBS) &amp; Epics</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Milestone</th>
      <th>Epic Ref</th>
      <th>Deliverables</th>
      <th>Status</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 1</td>
      <td>Epic 2</td>
      <td>Project Setup, Server folder, npm init, dependencies</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 2</td>
      <td>Epic 4</td>
      <td>MongoDB connection, User/Post/Comment schemas</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 3</td>
      <td>Epic 1</td>
      <td>JWT auth, Role Matrix middleware, validation, error handler</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 4</td>
      <td>Epic 3</td>
      <td>server.js, app.js, domain controllers, route files</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 5</td>
      <td>Epic 1 &amp; 3</td>
      <td>Gemini AI flow, blog synthesis, summarization</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Milestone 6</td>
      <td>Epic 5</td>
      <td>Database seeder, Postman collection, execution testing</td>
      <td>Completed</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Risk Management &amp; Contingencies</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Gemini API Quota Limits:</strong> Built-in heuristic fallback in geminiService ensures zero service disruption.</li>
  <li><strong>Unauthorized Privilege Escalation:</strong> Strict authorize(...roles) middleware asserts role from database.</li>
  <li><strong>DDoS &amp; Brute-Force:</strong> Dual rate limiters protect global endpoints (300/15m) and AI endpoints (50/10m).</li>
</ul>
</div>
</body>
